Usage: {{project-name}} text [-hV] [--dry-run] [--json] [--no-color] [--no-input]
                   [--quiet] [--verbose] [--format=<format>] [COMMAND]
Text transformations over the library core.
      --dry-run           Show what would happen without writing anything.
      --format=<format>   Output format for data commands: plain or json.
  -h, --help              Show this help message and exit.
      --json              Shorthand for --format json.
      --no-color          Disable colour in diagnostics (NO_COLOR is also
                            honoured).
      --no-input          Never prompt; fail instead of asking.
      --quiet             Suppress diagnostics.
  -V, --version           Print version information and exit.
      --verbose           Print diagnostics about what the command is doing.
Commands:
  slugify   Slugify text.
  truncate  Truncate text.
